[00:21.90]1. God is love, and he invites us:
[00:26.36]‘Walk with me and love my way.’
[00:32.14]When we love both God and neighbor,
[00:36.66]Gracious deeds will fill each day.
[00:42.52]Therein lies the key to living;
[00:47.02]Therein lies the life we seek.
[00:53.50]Christlike love will never fail us;
[00:59.92]Christlike love through us will speak.
[01:14.87]2. Love of truth moves us to action;
[01:20.17]Love of God moves us to love.
[01:25.01]When we fail he seeks to help us;
[01:29.61]By his strength we rise above.
[01:34.85]Love is pure and never jealous;
[01:39.79]Love is kind and bears all things.
[01:47.05]May we grow to love our brother;
[01:52.85]May we taste what true love brings.
[01:58.09]3. Never let resentment lead you;
[01:58.87]May it never take your hand.
[01:58.87]Look to God, and he will guide you;
[02:03.05]He will teach you these commands:
[02:04.43]Love of God and love of neighbor,
[02:32.99]Ev’rything that love should be.
[02:39.99]May we always show to others
[02:48.65]Godlike love, yes, tenderly.
